OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner's microlight crash
OL,4,Adeath was 'accident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has ruled the death of a
OL,7,Fcampaigner who died from injuries
OL,8,Fsustained in a microlight crash during
OL,9,Fa filming project for an Apple headset
OL,10,Fwas an accident.
OL,12,FClaire Lomas began fundraising after a
OL,13,Fhorse riding accident left her
OL,14,Fparalysed, with her efforts including
OL,15,Fcompleting the 2012 London Marathon in
OL,16,Fa "bionic" suit.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
