OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787226953
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner's microlight crash
OL,4,Adeath was 'accident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise Pinder, senior coroner for
OL,7,FRutland and North Leicestershire said
OL,8,FLomas was flying an adapted microlight
OL,9,Fin Jordan on 15 July 2024 when she made
OL,10,Fa "spilt second decision to abort the
OL,11,Flanding" as the aircraft was not
OL,12,F"perfectly aligned".
OL,14,FThe inquest heard the microlight
OL,15,Fcollided with rocks and she died from
OL,16,Fher injuries on 22 August 2024 at a
OL,17,Fhospital in Amman.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
